msgid ""
"`utils.config.DataLoaderConfig` 定义加载参数，`utils.model_data.create_optimized_dataloader()` 负责构建 DataLoader。技能级模型通过 `SkillModelData.create_windowlate_dataloader()` 创建 windowlate 加载器，并可通过 `_create_windowlate_dataset()` 扩展模型特有的窗口特征。"
msgstr ""
"`utils.config.DataLoaderConfig` defines loading options, while `utils.model_data.create_optimized_dataloader()` constructs DataLoaders. Skill-level models create windowlate loaders through `SkillModelData.create_windowlate_dataloader()` and can extend model-specific window features through `_create_windowlate_dataset()`."

